		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000002"]
			description: [
				"&eShafts&r carry rotation; &eCogwheels&r turn corners and change speed. This is your wiring now - lay it like you mean it."
				""
				"&e&lThe two numbers that run all of Create.&r"
				"&7- &fSpeed (RPM)&7 - how fast something turns. Machines have minimum speeds; some break above a maximum."
				"&7- &fStress (SU)&7 - how much load the network can carry. Every machine &lcosts&r stress; every generator &lsupplies&r it. Exceed your budget and the whole line stops dead."
				""
				"&e&lGearing changes one at the expense of the other.&r A &7Cogwheel&r next to a &7Large Cogwheel&r halves the speed and doubles the torque; the other way round doubles speed and halves it. You never get both."
				""
				"&c&lThe rule that catches everyone:&r a shaft can only be driven by &lone&r source. Two generators feeding the same line from opposite ends will lock it up and flash red. If a network jams, look for two things fighting over the same shaft."
				""
				"&7Put on the Engineer's Goggles from the next quest and look at any block - it shows the whole network's speed and stress budget live. Do not build blind.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:cogwheel"
			id: "44EA000000000003"
			rewards: [{
				count: 4
				id: "44EA000000000103"
				item: "create:shaft"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Rotation is power"
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 8L
					id: "44EA000000000203"
					item: "create:shaft"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 4L
