		{
			dependencies: ["44EA000000000003"]
			description: [
				"The &eWrench&r rotates, configures and instantly picks up any Create machine. &eEngineer's Goggles&r overlay stress and speed on everything you look at. Wear them always. Look brilliant."
				""
				"&e&lThe Wrench does four separate jobs:&r"
				"&7- &fRight-click&7 a shaft or cog to rotate it."
				"&7- &fRight-click&7 a machine to cycle its configuration - filter direction, funnel mode, gauge type."
				"&7- &fCrouch + right-click&7 to instantly pick a block up, keeping its settings. This is how you move a build without rebuilding it."
				"&7- &fRight-click&7 a Mechanical Belt to reverse it."
				""
				"&e&lThe Goggles are not cosmetic.&r Look at any shaft and you see the network's live SU budget - used versus available. Look at a machine and you see its individual draw. Look at a Stressometer or Speedometer and you get exact figures instead of a coloured bar."
				""
				"&7Nearly every Create problem - line stopped, machine idle, everything flashing - is diagnosable in two seconds with goggles on and invisible without them. Craft them early, not when you get stuck.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:goggles"
			id: "44EA000000000005"
			rewards: [{
				id: "44EA000000000105"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Dress for the job"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "44EA000000000205"
