				"Some recipes need &lheat&r. An empty &eBlaze Burner&r captures a blaze - which means a trip to a &cNether fortress&r, early and underdressed."
				""
				"Crucible lava + water = obsidian. Build the portal, bring blocks and courage, cage your first blaze. It will hold your basin at a boil forever."
