			description: [
				"The summit of kinetics: &6sequenced assembly&r. Deployers pass a golden sheet down the line, adding cogwheels and nails in perfect rhythm, until out rolls a &ePrecision Mechanism&r."
				""
				"&cThis is the key to the Electric Age&r - the Metallurgic Infuser is built around one. Craft it, and Mekanism opens."
				""
				"&2You built industry out of falling water. Age III opens: electricity.&r"
